{"t": 1794114194.9430735, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "[checkout] PaymentGatewayErrors (AG-7731) \u2014 root cause identified.\n\nCause: gateway API switched to 2026-11 (strict amounts) at 07:41 UTC. It now requires `amount` as an integer in minor units (cents). checkout was sending decimal euros (`12.34`), so charges were rejected 400 `invalid_amount` (4xx rate 38%).\n\nFix: checkout/gateway.py now converts EUR to integer cents (Decimal, round half up) before building the charge payload; verified 12.34 -> 1234, 19.99 -> 1999. No other changes. Deploy to clear the alert, then confirm 4xx rate returns to baseline."}, "ok": true}
